        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;padding-left:20px;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:6px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;API client&lt;/b&gt; calls the &lt;b&gt;HTTP API&lt;/b&gt; over HTTPS (&lt;font color=&quot;#5A6C86&quot;&gt;/domains&lt;/font&gt;, &lt;font color=&quot;#5A6C86&quot;&gt;/health&lt;/font&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:6px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;API Gateway&lt;/b&gt; invokes the &lt;b&gt;API function&lt;/b&gt; with the request.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:6px&quot;&gt;The function creates, reads and deletes domains in the &lt;b&gt;domains table&lt;/b&gt; (on-demand capacity).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:6px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;EventBridge Scheduler&lt;/b&gt; starts the &lt;b&gt;checker function&lt;/b&gt; once a day.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:6px&quot;&gt;The checker queries the domains due for a check and records each result.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:6px&quot;&gt;For each domain it opens a TLS connection on port 443 and reads the certificate&#x27;s expiry date.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:6px&quot;&gt;Certificates inside the alert window are published to the &lt;b&gt;alerts topic&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:6px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Amazon SNS&lt;/b&gt; emails every confirmed subscriber.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontColor=#232F3E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1320" y="140" width="350" height="780" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
